## Future improvements

- **Thread-safe variants** — a `threading.Lock`-wrapped repository for concurrent use.
- **Geographic coordinates** — swap Euclidean for Haversine behind the distance interface.
- **Incremental `max_radius`** — maintain the Chebyshev radius of the farthest cell during
  upsert/remove to eliminate the O(cells) precomputation in `GridDriverIndex.find_closest`.
- **Persistence adapters** — Redis or PostgreSQL implementations behind `DriverRepository`.
- **Configurable metrics** — timing/tracing hooks injected via a thin middleware layer.
